title: "P&C Loss Reserving Engine on CAS Schedule P Data"
abstract: >-
  Chain ladder, Bornhuetter-Ferguson, Cape Cod, Benktander, Munich chain ladder,
  Mack and ODP bootstrap reserving methods, validated against published results
  and backtested on 327 NAIC Schedule P triangles from the CAS Loss Reserving Database.
